    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kwa huwo idana, nichakaba chui rapo kwa wundu ghwa inyo kuwusa fwaida isefwanagha, na kwa kudia bagha aghadi konyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Welee, uko kufunga ndighi konyu kuchadua, angu mikonu yako kukaia na ndighi ingelo nakakubonya maza? Ini Bwana najighora ilagho iji, nani nichajikatisha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nichamsaghisa aghadi ya iro mbari ra wandu, na kumsasara masangenyi; nani nichaghumeria putu ugho wuchafu ghonyu ghose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuchalushwa imbiri ya iro mbari ra wandu, na oho kuchamanya kukaia Ini ne BWANA.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Iwiwi ja Mlungu jeelesha",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "BWANA ukaghora nani ukighamba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mwana wa mdamu, wandu wa Israeli waafwanana na wuchafu ghwasigharika ghwa feza, na shaba, na ibamba, na chuma, na risasi nyuma ya kueleshwa na kuinjwa kwa iwiwi ja modo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa huwo, ini Bwana MLUNGU naghamba huwu: Kwa kukaia inyo mmbose moofwanana na wuchafu ghwa feza yaeleshwa, olenyi nichamkwanya andenyi ya muzi ghwa Jerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na sa iji koni wandu wikwanyagha feza, na shaba, na chuma, na risasi na ibamba na kuvingira iwiwinyi ja modo, na kughupuputa hata visaghe, niko koni nichaamkwanya kwa machu na kwa lubio lwapo nipate kumsaghisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nichamkwanya na kumpuputa kwa modo ghwa machu ghapo, nenyo mchasagha aghadi yaro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sa iji feza isaghishwagha kwa modo ghubirie, na inyo wori mchasaghishwa andenyi ya muzi ghwa Jerusalemu, nenyo mchamanya machu ghapo aighu yenyu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
