          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "BWANA ukaghora nani ukighamba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mwana wa mdamu, kuwizere wandu wa Israeli kukaia isanga jawo ndejielie, jeeka sa isanga jisepatire vua ngelo jabonyerwa machu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wabaa wa isanga jawo weeka sa shimba irurumagha ikirashua madiwo ghake; wabwaghie wandu na kuwusa mali na vilambo vawo va zoghori mbaa, na kusigha waka wifuilo ni womi wengi isangenyi jawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakohani wawo wainona sharia yapo, na kuvilusha vilambo vapo va wueli; walemelo ni kusawua vilambo va wueli, na vilambo vizima, hata ndewifundishire wandu kusasawua iro maza rizamie na iro rielie; ndewiritalie Sabato rapo, na aho ngalushwa aghadi kwawo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.10.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wal. 10.10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wabaa wa ugho muzi weeka sa vikwau virashuagha madiwo ghawo; wibwaghagha, na kutotesha wandu, eri wipate fwaida isefwane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na walodi waro, weevisa agho mawiwi sa kukushinga chokaa naighu, nawo wiawona mawono ghiseko na wuloli, na kulodera wandu tee, wikighamba, ‘Bwana MLUNGU waghamba huwu,’ na BWANA useghambie ilagho jingi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waisanga weekuzaisira kukita na kusoka; wamkorongie mkiwa na uo usena kilambo chingi, na kumkita mghenyi kwa kumsoka hachi yake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neremlolieghe mndungi aghadi kwawo oagha ugho wurigha, nao ukaie kimusi andu kuvuchukie imbiri kwapo, upate kujidederia ijo isanga, eri nisejitoteshe, ela serewonieghe mndungi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa huwo niko nidirie machu ghapo aighu kwawo, na kuwimeria na modo ghwa lubio lwapo; na wuwiwi ghwa mabonyo ghawo ghuchakaia aighu yawo weni. Ini Bwana MLUNGU naghamba.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
